terly table (260.8; the 2018 10-Q comparative column shows 254.1 on the pre-2018 presentation) so 2017 adds up to the 10-K full year of 1,293.7.","FY2021Q4: EPS 10.37 set in the company map (Q4 2022 release (2023-02-22), Q4 2021 column: diluted total $10.37 (continuing 8.96, discontinued 1.41)). Full year less nine months gives the wrong Q4 diluted EPS when the share count changes sharply during the year (Whiting merger 2022, Enerplus 2024); Q4 uses the earnings release figure.","FY2022Q4: EPS 8.64 set in the company map (Q4 2022 release (2023-02-22): diluted $8.64). Full year less nine months gives the wrong Q4 diluted EPS when the share count changes sharply during the year (Whiting merger 2022, Enerplus 2024); Q4 uses the earnings release figure.","FY2023Q4: EPS 6.93 set in the company map (Q4 2023 release (2024-02-21): diluted $6.93). Full year less nine months gives the wrong Q4 diluted EPS when the share count changes sharply during the year (Whiting merger 2022, Enerplus 2024); Q4 uses the earnings release figure.","FY2024Q4: EPS 3.43 set in the company map (Q4 2024 release (2025-02-25): diluted $3.43). Full year less nine months gives the wrong Q4 diluted EPS when the share count changes sharply during the year (Whiting merger 2022, Enerplus 2024); Q4 uses the earnings release figure.","FY2025Q4: EPS 1.48 set in the company map (Q4 2025 release (2026-02-25): diluted $1.48). Full year less nine months gives the wrong Q4 diluted EPS when the share count changes sharply during the year (Whiting merger 2022, Enerplus 2024); Q4 uses the earnings release figure.","FY2023Q4: diluted shares 43.378m set in the company map (Q4 2023 release (2024-02-21): diluted weighted average shares 43,378 thousand)","FY2024Q4: diluted shares 61.221m set in the company map (Q4 2024 release (2025-02-25): diluted weighted average shares 61,221 thousand)","FY2025Q4: diluted shares 56.839m set in the company map (Q4 2025 release (2026-02-25): diluted weighted average shares 56,839 thous